[For "white"]
[Kind "sideline"]
[Start "giuoco-main 6.O-O"]
[Name "Giuoco Piano: the pin with ...Bg4"]

6... Bg4 { Pins the knight on f3 to the queen. [%icon pin@f3] [%idea pin] }
7. h3 { Asks the pinning bishop to decide: take on f3 or retreat. Either way the pin on the f3 knight goes. }
7... Bh5 8. Nbd2 { Brings out the last minor piece and defends the knight on f3 a second time. } *
